<main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
 <div><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Akril va aralashmali iplar · O'zbekiston</span><span class="en">Acrylic and blended yarns · Uzbekistan</span></span>
  <h1><span class="uz">Akril ip bo'yicha O'zbekistonning <em>eng yirik</em> ishlab chiqaruvchisi</span><span class="en">Uzbekistan's <em>largest</em> producer of acrylic yarn</span></h1>
  <p class="lead"><span class="uz">Zamonaviy korxonalarimizda trikotaj, to'quv va qo'lda to'qish uchun Nm2 dan Nm60 gacha iplar ishlab chiqaramiz va 20 ga yaqin mamlakatga eksport qilamiz.</span><span class="en">We spin knitting, weaving and hand-knitting yarns from Nm2 to Nm60 in state-of-the-art facilities and export to nearly 20 countries.</span></p>
  <div class="acts"><a class="btn" href="#products"><span class="uz">Mahsulotlarni ko'rish</span><span class="en">Explore products</span></a><a class="btn line" href="#colors"><span class="uz">Ranglar kartasi</span><span class="en">Colour card</span></a></div></div>
 <div class="fig"><canvas data-scene="hanks"></canvas><div class="cap"><b><span class="uz">Kalava bo'yash sexi</span><span class="en">Hank dyehouse</span></b><span class="uz">Namangan fabrikasi</span><span class="en">Namangan mill</span></div></div>
</div></section>

