<section class="sec" id="products"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="sec-head"><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Mahsulotlar</span><span class="en">Products</span></span><h2><span class="uz">Ip</span><span class="en">Yarn</span></h2>
  <p><span class="uz">Trikotaj, to'quv va qo'lda to'qish uchun 100% akril va aralashmali iplar. Har bir partiya mijoz spetsifikatsiyasi bo'yicha ishlab chiqariladi.</span><span class="en">100% acrylic and blended yarns for knitting, weaving and hand-knitting. Every lot is spun to the customer's specification.</span></p></div>
 <div class="row">
  <div class="fig"><canvas data-scene="spinning"></canvas></div>
  <div><div class="count">Nm 4–60 <small><span class="uz">nomer</span><span class="en">count</span></small></div>
   <h3><span class="uz">Kamvol ip</span><span class="en">Worsted yarn</span></h3>
   <p><span class="uz">Mijozlarimiz ehtiyojiga ko'ra Nm4 dan Nm60 gacha bo'lgan iplarni 100% akril, akril-jun, akril-poliamid, akril-neylon aralashmali, elastanli (PBT va laykra) hamda elastansiz ko'rinishda ishlab chiqaramiz.</span><span class="en">We produce yarns from Nm4 to Nm60 to our customers' needs: 100% acrylic, acrylic-wool, acrylic-polyamide and acrylic-nylon blends, with elastane (PBT and lycra) or without.</span></p>
   <dl class="spec"><div><dt><span class="uz">Tarkib</span><span class="en">Composition</span></dt><dd>100% PAN · PAN/WO · PAN/PA</dd></div><div><dt><span class="uz">Elastan</span><span class="en">Elastane</span></dt><dd><span class="uz">PBT yoki laykra, ixtiyoriy</span><span class="en">PBT or lycra, optional</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class="uz">Qo'llanish</span><span class="en">Use</span></dt><dd><span class="uz">Trikotaj, to'quv</span><span class="en">Knitting, weaving</span></dd></div></dl>
   <a class="more" href="#contact"><span class="uz">Batafsil →</span><span class="en">Details →</span></a></div>
 </div>
 <div class="row flip">
  <div class="fig"><canvas data-scene="creel"></canvas></div>
  <div><div class="count">Nm 2–16 <small><span class="uz">nomer</span><span class="en">count</span></small></div>
   <h3><span class="uz">Fantaziya ip</span><span class="en">Fancy yarn</span></h3>
   <p><span class="uz">Nm2 dan Nm16 gacha bo'lgan iplarni mijozlarimiz talab qilgan aralashma va nomerlarda, elastanli (PBT va laykra) va elastansiz, tukli (shardonlangan) va tuksiz ko'rinishda ishlab chiqaramiz.</span><span class="en">We produce yarns from Nm2 to Nm16 in the blends and counts our customers request, with or without elastane (PBT and lycra), brushed or unbrushed.</span></p>
   <dl class="spec"><div><dt><span class="uz">Tarkib</span><span class="en">Composition</span></dt><dd><span class="uz">Mijoz talabiga ko'ra</span><span class="en">To customer request</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class="uz">Ishlov</span><span class="en">Finish</span></dt><dd><span class="uz">Tukli yoki tuksiz</span><span class="en">Brushed or plain</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class="uz">Qo'llanish</span><span class="en">Use</span></dt><dd><span class="uz">Qo'lda to'qish, hajmli trikotaj</span><span class="en">Hand-knitting, bulky knits</span></dd></div></dl>
   <a class="more" href="#contact"><span class="uz">Batafsil →</span><span class="en">Details →</span></a></div>
 </div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec sec-alt" id="about"><div class="wrap">
 <h2 class="state"><span class="uz">Akril va akril aralashmali ip bo'yicha O'zbekistonning <em>eng yirik</em> ishlab chiqaruvchisi</span><span class="en">Uzbekistan's <em>largest</em> producer of acrylic and acrylic-blend yarn</span></h2>
 <div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><b>18</b><span><span class="uz">Eksport mamlakatlari</span><span class="en">Export countries</span></span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>45%</b><span><span class="uz">Ichki bozordagi ulush</span><span class="en">Share of domestic demand</span></span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>3</b><span><span class="uz">Ishlab chiqarish maydonchalari</span><span class="en">Production sites</span></span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>Nm 2–60</b><span><span class="uz">Nomer diapazoni</span><span class="en">Count range</span></span></div>
 </div>
 <div class="about-txt">
  <p class="uz">Akril va akril aralashmali ip ishlab chiqarishda O'zbekistonning eng yirik ishlab chiqaruvchisi bo'lgan ASL IP Markaziy Osiyoning yetakchi korxonalaridan biridir. Jami 18 mamlakatga eksport qilib, O'zbekistondagi akril va akril aralashmali ipga bo'lgan ehtiyojning 45 foizini ASL IP qondiradi.</p>
  <p class="uz">ASL IP zamonaviy ishlab chiqarish quvvatlari bilan sohadagi mavjud sifatlarni ishlab chiqarish bilan birga, bozor ehtiyojlarini hisobga olib, narx ustunligini taklif etadi va yangi mahsulotlar yaratish ustida ishlab, sohaning yetakchi korxonasi hisoblanadi.</p>
  <p class="en">ASL IP, the largest producer of acrylic and acrylic-blend yarn in Uzbekistan, is also among the leading producers in Central Asia. Exporting to 18 countries in total, ASL IP meets 45 percent of Uzbekistan's demand for acrylic and acrylic-blend yarn.</p>
  <p class="en">With state-of-the-art production facilities, ASL IP not only spins the qualities the sector already knows but watches what the market needs, offers a price advantage and keeps developing new products, which makes it the sector's pioneering company.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="wide"><canvas data-scene="factory" data-brand="#b8226a"></canvas></div>
 <div class="wcap"><span><span class="uz">Namangan fabrikasi, Chust tumani</span><span class="en">Namangan mill, Chust district</span></span><span><span class="uz">Ikki fabrika, bitta bosh ofis</span><span class="en">Two mills, one head office</span></span></div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" id="dyeing"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="sec-head"><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Mahsulotlar</span><span class="en">Products</span></span><h2><span class="uz">Bo'yash</span><span class="en">Dyeing</span></h2>
  <p><span class="uz">O'z bo'yash sexlarimizda ip bobina, kalava va jgut ko'rinishida bo'yaladi. Rang retsepturalari laboratoriyada tasdiqlanadi va har partiyada takrorlanadi.</span><span class="en">Our own dyehouses dye yarn on cone, in hank and as tow. Shade recipes are matched in the lab and repeated lot after lot.</span></p></div>
 <div class="grid3">
  <article class="dye"><div class="fig"><canvas data-scene="bobbins"></canvas></div><h3><span class="uz">Bobina</span><span class="en">Cone</span></h3><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Yumshoq o'ram · 0,9–1,5 kg</span><span class="en">Soft-wound · 0.9–1.5 kg</span></span><p><span class="uz">Yumshoq o'ramli bobinalarda bir xil rang va yuqori ranglilik chidamliligi.</span><span class="en">Even shade and high colour fastness on soft-wound packages.</span></p></article>
  <article class="dye"><div class="fig"><canvas data-scene="hanks"></canvas></div><h3><span class="uz">Kalava</span><span class="en">Hank</span></h3><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">An'anaviy usul · qo'lda to'qish</span><span class="en">Traditional · hand-knitting</span></span><p><span class="uz">Qo'lda to'qish va hajmli iplar uchun an'anaviy kalava bo'yash.</span><span class="en">Traditional hank dyeing for hand-knitting and bulky yarns.</span></p></article>
  <article class="dye"><div class="fig"><canvas data-scene="tow"></canvas></div><h3>Tow</h3><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Tola bosqichi · melanj</span><span class="en">Fibre stage · melange</span></span><p><span class="uz">Tola bosqichida bo'yash orqali melanj va to'q ranglarda barqaror natija.</span><span class="en">Fibre-stage dyeing for stable results in melange and deep shades.</span></p></article>
 </div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" id="order"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="sec-head"><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Buyurtma</span><span class="en">Order</span></span><h2><span class="uz">Ariza yuboring</span><span class="en">Send an order request</span></h2>
  <p><span class="uz">Ip turi, nomeri, tarkibi, shakli va ranglarini tanlang. Menejerimiz 1 ish kuni ichida narx va namunalar bilan javob beradi. Buyurtma majburiyat emas.</span><span class="en">Choose the yarn type, count, composition, form and colours. Our manager replies within one business day with a price and samples. Sending a request is not a commitment.</span></p></div>
 <div class="order" id="orderWrap">
  <form class="form" id="orderForm" novalidate>
   <fieldset><legend><span class="uz">1 · Mahsulot</span><span class="en">1 · Product</span></legend>
    <div class="opts">
     <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="product" value="kamvol" id="p-kamvol" checked><span class="box"><span class="uz">Kamvol ip</span><span class="en">Worsted yarn</span><small><span class="uz">Nm 4–60 · trikotaj, to'quv</span><span class="en">Nm 4–60 · knitting, weaving</span></small></span></label>
     <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="product" value="fantaziya" id="p-fantaziya"><span class="box"><span class="uz">Fantaziya ip</span><span class="en">Fancy yarn</span><small><span class="uz">Nm 2–16 · qo'lda to'qish, hajmli trikotaj</span><span class="en">Nm 2–16 · hand-knitting, bulky knits</span></small></span></label>
    </div></fieldset>
   <fieldset><legend><span class="uz">2 · Spetsifikatsiya</span><span class="en">2 · Specification</span></legend>
    <div class="f2">
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-count"><span class="uz">Ip nomeri</span><span class="en">Yarn count</span> <small>Nm</small></label><select id="f-count"></select></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-ply"><span class="uz">Qatlam</span><span class="en">Ply</span></label><select id="f-ply"><option value="1" data-uz="1 qat" data-en="Single">1 qat</option><option value="2" data-uz="2 qat" data-en="2-ply">2 qat</option><option value="3" data-uz="3 qat" data-en="3-ply">3 qat</option></select></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-comp"><span class="uz">Tarkib</span><span class="en">Composition</span></label><select id="f-comp"><option value="100pan" data-uz="100% akril" data-en="100% acrylic">100% akril</option><option value="pan-wo" data-uz="Akril / jun" data-en="Acrylic / wool">Akril / jun</option><option value="pan-pa" data-uz="Akril / poliamid" data-en="Acrylic / polyamide">Akril / poliamid</option><option value="pan-ny" data-uz="Akril / neylon" data-en="Acrylic / nylon">Akril / neylon</option><option value="other" data-uz="Boshqa (izohda yozing)" data-en="Other (describe in comment)">Boshqa (izohda yozing)</option></select></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-elast"><span class="uz">Elastan</span><span class="en">Elastane</span></label><select id="f-elast"><option value="none" data-uz="Elastansiz" data-en="None">Elastansiz</option><option value="pbt" data-uz="PBT" data-en="PBT">PBT</option><option value="lycra" data-uz="Laykra" data-en="Lycra">Laykra</option></select></div>
     <div class="fld" id="fld-finish" hidden><label for="f-finish"><span class="uz">Ishlov</span><span class="en">Finish</span></label><select id="f-finish"><option value="plain" data-uz="Tuksiz" data-en="Plain">Tuksiz</option><option value="brushed" data-uz="Tukli (shardon)" data-en="Brushed">Tukli (shardon)</option></select></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-form"><span class="uz">Shakl</span><span class="en">Form</span></label><select id="f-form"><option value="cone" data-uz="Bobina" data-en="Cone">Bobina</option><option value="hank" data-uz="Kalava" data-en="Hank">Kalava</option><option value="tow" data-uz="Jgut (tow)" data-en="Tow">Jgut (tow)</option></select></div>
    </div></fieldset>
   <fieldset id="fs-colors"><legend><span class="uz">3 · Ranglar</span><span class="en">3 · Colours</span></legend>
    <div class="sel" id="selList"></div>
    <p class="fmsg"><span class="uz">Kamida bitta rang tanlang.</span><span class="en">Select at least one colour.</span></p>
    <div class="addc"><input id="f-custom" type="text" placeholder="Boshqa PANTONE TCX kodi, masalan 18-1750" data-ph-uz="Boshqa PANTONE TCX kodi, masalan 18-1750" data-ph-en="Another PANTONE TCX code, e.g. 18-1750" autocomplete="off"><button class="btn line" type="button" id="addCustom"><span class="uz">Qo'shish</span><span class="en">Add</span></button></div>
    <p class="hint"><span class="uz">Har bir rang uchun kg ni ixtiyoriy kiriting. </span><span class="en">Kilograms per colour are optional. </span><a href="#colors"><span class="uz">Ranglar kartasiga qaytish ↑</span><span class="en">Back to the colour card ↑</span></a></p>
   </fieldset>
   <fieldset><legend><span class="uz">4 · Miqdor va muddat</span><span class="en">4 · Quantity and timing</span></legend>
    <div class="f2">
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-qty"><span class="uz">Umumiy miqdor</span><span class="en">Total quantity</span> <small>kg</small></label><input id="f-qty" type="number" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="500"><p class="fmsg"><span class="uz">Miqdorni kg da kiriting.</span><span class="en">Enter the quantity in kg.</span></p></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-date"><span class="uz">Kerakli muddat</span><span class="en">Needed by</span> <small><span class="uz">(ixtiyoriy)</span><span class="en">(optional)</span></small></label><input id="f-date" type="date"></div>
    </div></fieldset>
   <fieldset><legend><span class="uz">5 · Aloqa ma'lumotlari</span><span class="en">5 · Contact details</span></legend>
    <div class="f2">
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-company"><span class="uz">Kompaniya</span><span class="en">Company</span></label><input id="f-company" type="text" autocomplete="organization"></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-name"><span class="uz">Ism-familiya</span><span class="en">Full name</span></label><input id="f-name" type="text" autocomplete="name"><p class="fmsg"><span class="uz">Ismingizni kiriting.</span><span class="en">Enter your name.</span></p></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-phone"><span class="uz">Telefon</span><span class="en">Phone</span></label><input id="f-phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+998 90 000 00 00"><p class="fmsg"><span class="uz">Telefon raqamini kiriting.</span><span class="en">Enter a phone number.</span></p></div>
     <div class="fld"><label for="f-email">Email</label><input id="f-email" type="email" autocomplete="email"><p class="fmsg"><span class="uz">To'g'ri email kiriting.</span><span class="en">Enter a valid email.</span></p></div>
     <div class="fld full"><label for="f-city"><span class="uz">Shahar / mamlakat</span><span class="en">City / country</span></label><input id="f-city" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2"></div>
     <div class="fld full"><label for="f-comment"><span class="uz">Izoh</span><span class="en">Comment</span> <small><span class="uz">(ixtiyoriy)</span><span class="en">(optional)</span></small></label><textarea id="f-comment" placeholder="Rang bo'yicha taqsimot, o'ram og'irligi, yetkazib berish shartlari..." data-ph-uz="Rang bo'yicha taqsimot, o'ram og'irligi, yetkazib berish shartlari..." data-ph-en="Split by colour, package weight, delivery terms..."></textarea></div>
    </div>
    <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f-consent"><span><span class="uz">Ma'lumotlarim ushbu so'rovni ko'rib chiqish uchun ishlatilishiga roziman.</span><span class="en">I agree that my details are used to process this request.</span></span></label>
   </fieldset>
   <div><button class="btn" type="submit"><span class="uz">Ariza yuborish</span><span class="en">Send request</span></button></div>
  </form>
  <div class="done" id="done" role="status"><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Ariza</span><span class="en">Request</span></span><h3><span class="uz">Arizangiz qabul qilindi</span><span class="en">Your request has been received</span></h3><div class="ref" id="ref">ASL-000000-0000</div>
   <p><span class="uz">Bu raqamni saqlab qo'ying. Menejerimiz 1 ish kuni ichida narx va namunalar bilan bog'lanadi.</span><span class="en">Keep this reference. Our manager will get back within one business day with a price and samples.</span></p>
   <pre id="sumText"></pre>
   <div class="acts"><a class="btn" id="mailto" href="#order"><span class="uz">Email orqali ham yuborish</span><span class="en">Also send by email</span></a><button class="btn line" type="button" id="copyBtn"><span class="uz">Nusxa olish</span><span class="en">Copy</span></button><button class="btn line" type="button" id="againBtn"><span class="uz">Yangi ariza</span><span class="en">New request</span></button></div></div>
  <aside class="osum" aria-live="polite"><h3><span class="uz">Sizning so'rovingiz</span><span class="en">Your request</span></h3><dl id="sum"></dl>
   <ol><li><span class="uz">Arizani yuborasiz</span><span class="en">You send the request</span></li><li><span class="uz">1 ish kuni ichida narx va namunalar</span><span class="en">Price and samples within one business day</span></li><li><span class="uz">Tasdiqlash, ishlab chiqarish va yetkazib berish</span><span class="en">Confirmation, production and delivery</span></li></ol></aside>
 </div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec sec-alt" id="quality"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="sec-head"><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Korporativ</span><span class="en">Corporate</span></span><h2><span class="uz">Sifat va sertifikatlar</span><span class="en">Quality and certificates</span></h2>
  <p><span class="uz">Har bir partiya ip nomeri, burama soni, uzilish kuchi va cho'zilish bo'yicha tekshiriladi. Bo'yalgan iplar yuvish, ishqalanish va yorug'likka chidamlilik testlaridan o'tadi.</span><span class="en">Every lot is checked for count, twist, tenacity and elongation. Dyed yarns pass washing, rubbing and light-fastness tests before they ship.</span></p></div>
 <div class="certs">
  <div class="cert"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><text x="32" y="37" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">GRS</text></svg><span><span class="uz">Global qayta ishlash standarti</span><span class="en">Global Recycled Standard</span></span></div>
  <div class="cert"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><text x="32" y="37" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">RCS</text></svg><span><span class="uz">Qayta ishlangan tarkib</span><span class="en">Recycled Claim Standard</span></span></div>
  <div class="cert"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><text x="32" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">OEKO-TEX</text><text x="32" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">STD 100</text></svg><span>OEKO-TEX Standard 100</span></div>
  <div class="cert"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><text x="32" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">ISO</text><text x="32" y="43" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">9001</text></svg><span><span class="uz">Sifat menejmenti</span><span class="en">Quality management</span></span></div>
  <div class="cert"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><text x="32" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">ISO</text><text x="32" y="43" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">14001</text></svg><span><span class="uz">Atrof-muhit menejmenti</span><span class="en">Environmental management</span></span></div>
  <div class="cert"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><text x="32" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">ISO</text><text x="32" y="43" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">27001</text></svg><span><span class="uz">Axborot xavfsizligi</span><span class="en">Information security</span></span></div>
  <div class="cert"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".8" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><text x="32" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">ISO</text><text x="32" y="43" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif">50001</text></svg><span><span class="uz">Energiya menejmenti</span><span class="en">Energy management</span></span></div>
 </div>
 <ul class="pol">
  <li><a href="#quality"><span class="uz">Sifat siyosati</span><span class="en">Quality policy</span></a></li>
  <li><a href="#quality"><span class="uz">Atrof-muhit siyosati</span><span class="en">Environmental policy</span></a></li>
