 </ul>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="nlbox"><div><h3><span class="uz">Yangiliklar obunasi</span><span class="en">Newsletter</span></h3><p><span class="uz">Yangi ranglar, mahsulotlar va maxsus takliflardan birinchi bo'lib xabardor bo'ling.</span><span class="en">Be the first to hear about new shades, products and special offers.</span></p></div>
