<section class="sec sec-alt" id="contact"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="sec-head"><span class="kicker"><span class="uz">Aloqa</span><span class="en">Contact</span></span><h2><span class="uz">Biz bilan bog'laning</span><span class="en">Get in touch</span></h2>
  <p><span class="uz">Namunalar, narx so'rovlari va texnik savollar uchun bosh ofis yoki fabrikalarimizga murojaat qiling.</span><span class="en">For samples, price enquiries and technical questions, contact the head office or either mill directly.</span></p></div>
 <div class="loc">
