  <article><h3><span class="uz">Andijon fabrikasi</span><span class="en">Andijan mill</span></h3><p><span class="uz">Andijon viloyati, Asaka tumani, "Andijon" erkin iqtisodiy zonasi, 7-uchastka</span><span class="en">"Andijan" free economic zone, Lot 7, Asaka district, Andijan region</span></p><a href="tel:+998742893040">+998 (74) 289 30 40</a><a href="mailto:andijon@aslip.uz">andijon@aslip.uz</a></article>
